cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper.
title: >-
  bsbe_mtt_cmkf: multi-target tracking of single targets in broadband
  split-beam echosounder data
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of single-target detection and multi-target tracking in
  broadband split-beam echosounder recordings, using a converted measurement
  Kalman filter with the conversion Jacobian evaluated at the predicted
  position.
type: software
authors:
